:: Spell_Combat

    <<nobr>>
        <<done>>
            <<if $spellCastVar.spellTarget.stats.life.cur <= 0>>
                <<set $spellCastVar.spellTarget.stats.life.cur = $spellCastVar.spellTarget.stats.life.max>>
                <<set $spellCastVar.availableTargets.critters = []>>
                <<set $spellCastVar.spellTarget = ''>>
                <<run UI.alert('You won!')>>
                <<set $eventVar.inCombat = false>>
                <<set $eventVar.combatPass = ''>>
            <</if>>
        <</done>>


    <</nobr>>

    This is the spell combat passage. Should only display after casting spell when in combat.
        <<speech plr>>I successfully cast my <i>$spellCastVar.spellEffect</i> spell at the $spellCastVar.spellTarget.name and did $spellCastVar.damageDone damage to it.<</speech>>
    <<speech plr>>The CREATURE DID/DID NOT do # DAMAGE to me.<</speech>>

    <<button [[Continue | previous()]]>>
    
    <</button>>